<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - East Valley Sch Dist 361, Wash.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - East Valley Sch Dist 361, Wash.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it has received the award on the $4.800 million East Valley School District No 361, Wash., unlimited tax general obligation bonds, with a top yield of 4.85 percent in 2007.</p>
